      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/cc9497/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-12-14T20:11:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Kratos13\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/65b543/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Kratos13:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>(…)</p>\n<p>So far Handelbra hasn’t implemented this ability (to spot Shinobi Assassins) but probably didn’t need to (the game will prompt/warn the player who is about to draw a Shinobi Assassin).&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(…)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Well, I guess I got a pretty nasty bug, because I can check card’s back (for Shinobi) since many years. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Like I can spot a construct on top of&nbsp;Guise’s deck or many other weird stuff like that.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Otherwise what I’m most impatient is … the main event : How OblivAeon mode looks like, oh and Completionnist Guise</p>",
      "post_number": 12,
