      "raw": "[quote=\"Kratos13\"]\n\n(...)\n\nSo far Handelbra hasn’t implemented this ability (to spot Shinobi Assassins) but probably didn’t need to (the game will prompt/warn the player who is about to draw a Shinobi Assassin).&nbsp;&nbsp;\n\n(...)\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nWell, I guess I got a pretty nasty bug, because I can check card's back (for Shinobi) since many years. :)\n\nLike I can spot a construct on top of&nbsp;Guise's deck or many other weird stuff like that.\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n\nOtherwise what I'm most impatient is ... the main event : How OblivAeon mode looks like, oh and Completionnist Guise\n",
