    {
      "id": 224645,
      "name": "Phantom5613",
      "username": "Phantom5613",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-12-15T14:29:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Kratos13\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/65b543/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Kratos13:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Is it too soon to start the hype train yet?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It’s never too soon to start the hype train.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Kratos13\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/65b543/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Kratos13:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>What else are people looking forward to see?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I’m looking forward to playing and learning all the new heroes, and figuring out all the possible interesting combos that they can create, both in their own decks and together.</p>\n<p>I also look forward to actually getting to PLAY OblivAeon. I still haven’t had the chance to play the physical version…</p>",
      "post_number": 13,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:58:05.488Z",
