      "raw": "[quote=\"Kratos13\"]\n\nIs it too soon to start the hype train yet?\n\n[/quote]\n\nIt's never too soon to start the hype train.\n\n[quote=\"Kratos13\"]\n\nWhat else are people looking forward to see?\n\n[/quote]\n\nI'm looking forward to playing and learning all the new heroes, and figuring out all the possible interesting combos that they can create, both in their own decks and together.\n\nI also look forward to actually getting to PLAY OblivAeon. I still haven't had the chance to play the physical version...\n",
